### Create room
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "labId": 1,
  "name": "Chemistry Room 101",
  "type": "EXPERIMENT_ROOM",
  "floor": 1,
  "area": 42.50
}

### View all rooms
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms

### View rooms by lab
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?labId=1

### Search rooms
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?search=chem

### View room by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1

### Update room
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Chemistry Room 101A",
  "type": "EXPERIMENT_ROOM",
  "floor": 1,
  "area": 45.00
}

### Deactivate room
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/deactivate

### Activate room (the parent lab must be active)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/activate
